msgid ""
"Tailscale cannot write this device's DNS settings, so it can no longer keep "
"peer names working. They may still resolve for now, from the configuration "
"left over from before the failure, but that will break the next time the "
"network changes — and BigLace will fall back to IP addresses. On most "
"distributions `sudo resolvconf -u` repairs it."
msgstr ""
"Tailscale 无法写入此设备的 DNS "
"设置，因此无法继续让对等设备名称正常工作。目前它们可能仍能依靠故障前遗留的配置进行解析，但下次网络变化时就会失效——BigLace 将改用 IP "
"地址。在大多数发行版上，运行 `sudo resolvconf -u` 即可修复。"

msgid "Not connected"
msgstr "未连接"

msgid "Press Connect on the left to join the network."
msgstr "点击左侧的“连接”以加入网络。"

msgid "The tailscale service is not running"
msgstr "Tailscale 服务未运行"

msgid "BigLace needs the tailscaled background service to manage the network."
msgstr "BigLace 需要 tailscaled 后台服务来管理网络。"

msgid "Start service"
msgstr "启动服务"

msgid "Join the network"
msgstr "加入网络"

msgid "Choose how you're going to sign in."
msgstr "选择你的登录方式。"

msgid "Ways to sign in"
msgstr "登录方式"

msgid "Your account was kept on this computer. No invite needed."
msgstr "你的账户已保存在这台计算机上。无需邀请。"

msgid "I have an invite"
msgstr "我有邀请"

msgid "Someone on the network sent you a link or a QR code."
msgstr "网络中的某人给你发送了链接或二维码 (QR)。"

msgid "I have an access key"
msgstr "我有访问密钥"

msgid "A key the administrator created for you (starts with hskey-auth-)."
msgstr "管理员为你创建的密钥（以 hskey-auth- 开头）。"

msgid "I'm the administrator"
msgstr "我是管理员"

msgid "Sign in with the BigScale panel's admin username and password."
msgstr "使用 BigScale 面板的管理员用户名和密码登录。"

msgid "This device"
msgstr "本设备"

msgid "Copy IP address"
msgstr "复制 IP 地址"

msgid "Devices on the network"
msgstr "网络中的设备"

msgid "No other devices on the network yet."
msgstr "网络上尚无其他设备。"

msgid "Sections"
msgstr "分区"

msgid ""
"Your identity on this mesh — the device name shown to other peers and the "
"network you're connected to."
msgstr "您在此网格中的身份——向其他对等节点显示的设备名称以及您所连接的网络。"

msgid "Change photo…"
msgstr "更改照片…"

msgid "Remove photo"
msgstr "移除照片"

msgid "Change your photo"
msgstr "更改你的照片"

msgid "Rename this device on the network"
msgstr "重命名此设备在网络上的名称"

msgid "Advanced: use a pre-auth key"
msgstr "高级：使用预授权密钥"

msgid "Already have a key from your administrator? Paste it here."
msgstr "已有管理员提供的密钥？请在此粘贴。"

msgid ""
"Manual setup — expand to paste a server URL and pre-auth key when you "
"already received them from your administrator. Most users should sign in "
"through the panel button above instead."
msgstr "手动设置——展开以粘贴您已从管理员处收到的服务器 URL 和预授权密钥。大多数用户应改为通过上方面板按钮登录。"

msgid ""
"Address of the coordination server (e.g. vpn.example.org). The https:// "
"scheme is added automatically if you omit it."
msgstr "协调服务器的地址（例如 vpn.example.org）。如果您省略，系统会自动添加 https:// 方案。"

msgid "Pre-auth key"
msgstr "预授权密钥"

msgid ""
"One-time or reusable key created on the server (starts with 'hskey-auth-'). "
"Used to register this device automatically without opening a browser."
msgstr "在服务器上创建的一次性或可重复使用的密钥（以 'hskey-auth-' 开头）。用于无需打开浏览器即可自动注册此设备。"

msgid ""
"The name this device shows to other peers on the VPN — this is the Tailscale"
" hostname, NOT your computer's name and NOT your user. Lowercase letters, "
"digits and hyphens. Example: 'tales-laptop', 'francois', 'office-pc'."
msgstr ""
"此设备向 VPN 上其他对等节点显示的名称——这是 Tailscale "
"主机名，不是您计算机的名称，也不是您的用户名。小写字母、数字和连字符。例如：'tales-laptop'、'francois'、'office-pc'。"

msgid "Apply manual setup"
msgstr "应用手动设置"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid ""
"Persist the server, key and device name above. Won't connect — press Connect"
" afterwards."
msgstr "持久化保存上述服务器、密钥和设备名称。不会自动连接——请随后点击“连接”。"

msgid "Connect automatically"
msgstr "自动连接"

msgid "Join the network when BigLace starts"
msgstr "BigLace 启动时加入网络"

msgid ""
"When on, BigLace runs 'tailscale up' as soon as it launches, so you join the"
" mesh without clicking Connect every time."
msgstr "开启后，BigLace 会在启动时立即运行 'tailscale up'，这样您无需每次都点击“连接”即可加入网格。"

msgid "Toggle auto-connect on startup"
msgstr "切换启动时自动连接"

msgid "Start BigLace with the session"
msgstr "随会话启动 BigLace"

msgid "Open BigLace after you sign in to the desktop"
msgstr "登录桌面后打开 BigLace"

msgid ""
"Turn this on to add BigLace to your desktop session startup. Turn it off to "
"remove it."
msgstr "开启此选项可将 BigLace 添加到桌面会话启动项中。关闭则可将其移除。"

msgid "Toggle start with session"
msgstr "切换随会话启动"

msgid "Reconnect on drop"
msgstr "断线重连"

msgid "Retry with backoff when the connection is lost"
msgstr "连接断开时启用退避重试"

msgid ""
"If the tunnel drops (network change, sleep, server hiccup), BigLace silently"
" retries with growing delays instead of leaving you offline until you "
"notice."
msgstr "如果隧道断开（网络变更、休眠、服务器故障），BigLace 会静默重试，且重试间隔逐渐增加，而不会让您离线直到您注意到。"

msgid "Toggle auto-reconnect"
msgstr "切换自动重连"

msgid "Notify on peer changes"
msgstr "节点变更通知"

msgid "Show a desktop notification when peers go online/offline"
msgstr "当节点上线/离线时显示桌面通知"

msgid ""
"Send a desktop toast when another device on your network goes online or "
"offline. Rapid bursts are coalesced into a single notification so you don't "
"get spammed during reconnects."
msgstr "当您网络上的另一设备上线或离线时，发送桌面通知。快速爆发的事件会合并为一条通知，以免在重连期间被频繁打扰。"

msgid "Toggle peer-change notifications"
msgstr "切换对等节点变更通知"

msgid ""
"Join or leave the mesh network. When connected, this device becomes "
"reachable by the other peers in your account."
msgstr "加入或离开网状网络。连接后，此设备将可被您账户中的其他对等节点访问。"

msgid "Your photo"
msgstr "你的照片"

msgid ""
"Each of your groups has a voice room. Join it and talk with whoever is there"
" — the sound goes straight between you, through the network."
msgstr "你的每个群组都有一个语音房间。加入后即可与房间里的人交谈——声音通过网络直接在你们之间传输。"

msgid "You're not in any group yet. Create one in Groups."
msgstr "你还不在任何群组中。请在“群组”中创建一个。"

msgid "People in the room"
msgstr "房间中的人"

msgid "Everyone"
msgstr "所有人"

msgid "Who's speaking"
msgstr "正在说话的人"

msgid "Mute"
msgstr "静音"

