msgstr "共享屏幕时包含计算机声音"

msgid ""
"Videos and music playing here go to the room too; the room's voices don't "
"(no echo)"
msgstr "此处播放的视频和音乐也会传到房间；房间里的语音则不会（无回声）"

msgid "Rooms unavailable"
msgstr "房间不可用"

